              "id": "0aabe399-c045-4f54-a6ec-41709b4431bf",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "Hi, we run a small bakery chain with 3 locations and our current website looks like it's from 2010. We need a full redesign plus an online ordering system so customers can order ahead for pickup. We have budget set aside (around $8-12k) and would like to get started this month if possible. Can we set up a call this week?",
