        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a lead qualification assistant for a small service business.\nScore the lead message below from 0-10 using these criteria:\n- Clarity of need (0-2): do they know what they want?\n- Budget signal (0-3): did they mention a number or budget authority?\n- Urgency/timeline (0-2): is there a deadline or stated urgency?\n- Decision authority (0-2): are they the decision-maker?\n- Service fit (0-1): does the request match services offered?\n\nIf the message is an outbound vendor pitch / spam, score it 0 and set status to \"Spam/Vendor Pitch\" regardless of the above.\n\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON in this exact shape:\n{\"score\": <int 0-10>, \"status\": \"<Hot Lead|Nurture|Not a Fit|Spam/Vendor Pitch>\", \"reasoning\": \"<one sentence>\"}\n\nLead message:\n\"\"\"{{ $json.message }}\"\"\""
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.anthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
