            {
              "content": "=You are drafting a follow-up email for a NURTURE lead — someone with a real need but no urgency or budget clarity yet. Write a warm, low-pressure email reply to {{ $json.name }} at {{ $json.company }}.\n\nContext on why they're in the nurture stage (not sales-ready yet):\n{{ $json.reasoning }}\n\nThe email should:\n- Thank them for reaching out\n- Acknowledge their situation without pushing for a sale or a call\n- Offer one small, genuinely useful piece of advice or resource related to their need\n- Leave the door open (\"reply anytime if you want to talk more\")\n- Sign off as [Your name]\n\nWrite ONLY the email body — no subject line, no explanation, no markdown."
            }
