              "content": "=You are drafting a polite decline email for a lead that is NOT A FIT — either no commercial need, no budget, or outside what the business offers. Write a brief, warm, professional reply to {{ $json.name }} at {{ $json.company }}.\n\nContext on why this isn't a fit:\n{{ $json.reasoning }}\n\nThe email should:\n- Thank them for reaching out\n- Politely explain you're not able to help with this particular request (without being blunt or dismissive)\n- If appropriate, offer one small alternative form of help (e.g. answering a quick question) instead of a full engagement\n- Sign off as [Your name]\n\nWrite ONLY the email body — no subject line, no explanation, no markdown."
